# Compiled dx_npu_stats helper — must NOT be committed. It is a native binary that
# links dxrt IPC internals, so a checked-in build breaks on any board with a different
# glibc/ABI (the reason NPU util/temp showed simulated data on older boards). NPU
# utilization and DRAM now come from the dx_engine Python API (shared/hardware.py); this
# binary is optional, device-info-only, and should be built per-board — never shipped.
dx_app/dx_npu_stats
